From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 03:46:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 2114 (tester 56030): a time-of-day greeting typed without
 care is still one

"dilamshvidobis" (no space, final "a" missing) was not recognized, so
the full model ran (~35 s, 3 tools), copied the typo and pitched. Both
greeting matchers now take the space and the final letter as optional,
and the server's echo writes the same words spelled right. No new text.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
